  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northleoda">Norðleod.</ref> 10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And þeah he geþeo, þæt he hæbbe helm 7 byrnan 7 golde fæted sweord, gif he þæt land nafað, he bið ceorl swa þeah.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And even if he prospers so that he possesses a helmet and a coat of mail and a gold-plated sword, if he has not the land, he is a ceorl all the same.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 þeh he geþeo, þæt he hæbbe helm 7 byrnan 7 goldfæted sweord, gif he þæt land nafaþ, he byþ ceorl swa þeah.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">Yet even if he prospers so that he possesses a helmet and a coat of mail and a gold-plated sword, if he does not possess the land, he will still be a layman.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
